Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,公路在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…freakin' alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克爆炸时我们站得太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing too close to exploding Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,被炸进了炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}sends your ass straight to purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 救你一命都不说句谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No thanks for saving you, ha?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有你想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么东西 - 离开的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, what's that? - A way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.57,0:00:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭个顺风车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hopping a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了 兄弟 我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it, brother. I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.59,0:00:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小卡呢 他也在那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Cass? Was he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡没能逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Cass didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.99,0:00:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我想我们还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I think we better g…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.94,0:00:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小卡死了 你亲眼看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Cass is dead? You saw him die?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想做什么先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他是我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却连电话也不接\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you couldn't answer the damn phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之王刚扭断了我女朋友的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of hell just snapped my girlfriend's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力抓走了你 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley kidnapped you. I saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:00:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你逃出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying you escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:00:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么逃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有块碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一块碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块碑有名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did this tablet have a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,「恶魔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Demons."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱逐地球上的所有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banish all demons off the face of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.97,0:01:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们永远关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock them away forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:12.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:15.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊利诺伊州 芝加哥）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉让您久等了 维利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So sorry to have kept you waiting, Mr. Vili.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 您很久没跟我们联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…it's been so long since you checked in with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在档案馆找了半天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to dig through our archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,您说是哪个箱子来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which box is it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.11,0:01:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是说第一号箱子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say one, as in box number one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没记错的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If memory serves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上次翻修的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}During our last renovation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把原先的保险箱都换了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had to replace the safe boxes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的保险箱就放在新保险箱中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we put yours inside a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.31,0:02:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 那是根骨头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…sorry, sir, but…is that a bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.11,0:02:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是根普通的骨头 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just any bone, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是根无比珍贵的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}An extremely valuable one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…很高兴这些年来我们能为您安全保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm happy we were able to keep it safe for you all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天还有什么需要我帮忙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else I can help you with today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对 说起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes, now that I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要「提款」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to make a withdrawal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第8季第2集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.63,0:03:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定是开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想顺道看望我妈这个要求过分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it too much to ask if we can swing by and check on my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,「顺道」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Swing by"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要朝相反的方向开一天的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a day's drive in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.31,0:03:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道我们赶时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I understand we're in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那你干什么还要问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, then, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想钱宁被拧断的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Channing's broken neck is my problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想见到我妈被拧成螺旋状\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in I'd rather not see my mom twisted into a corkscrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这孩子说的对 迪恩 - 你别管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kid's got a point, Dean. - Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 你妈妈好着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, your mom is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you possibly know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.43,0:03:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为克劳力需要她好好活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Crowley needs her to be, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他很可能让一群保镖守着她的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, he's probably got the place stacked with bodyguards right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护着她 这样你一出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}protecting her so that when you do show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能把你俩一起抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll pounce on you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这话是想安慰我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that supposed to make me feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个诱饵 老弟 就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's bait, man, plain and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.55,0:03:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想主动奔过去咬钩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to swim right up and bite the hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们能制住克劳利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we have got Crowley by the short and curlies, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要找到那块石碑 喊出咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need to do is find the tablet, whip up the spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘭 从此天下太平\N{\fnArial\fs30}and … boom! … sunshine and sandy beaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我妈妈孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, my mom's all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.29,0:04:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,被恶魔们包围着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's surrounded by demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的无法理解我想去看望她的心情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you really not understand why I want to make sure she's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 咱们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.47,0:04:28.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密歇根 内博市）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎妈 九点方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiger mom, 9:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,左窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left window.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难过 但是没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sad…but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那个邮差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out the mailman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就我们停下来这会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, Carl's filled your mom's mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔往你妈妈邮箱里塞了三次信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}three times since we've been sitting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.57,0:05:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那个园丁没\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see the gardener?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那些植物还没浇够水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think that plant needs any more water?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会回来的 你要坚信这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be back. You just have to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 尤尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Eunis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.65,0:06:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚信这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I do believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是 希望我能做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… wish I could do more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达 你能做的只有待在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda, you're doing all you should by staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.68,0:06:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得知道自己有家可归\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to know he has a home to come back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kev… Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eunis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是尤尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Eunis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭太太 您的朋友被恶魔附体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Tran, your friend was possessed by a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.23,Title,0,0,0,0,,你看过《驱魔人》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen "The exorcist"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这一年就去干这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you've been doing all year …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching television?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非得杀死她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really have to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不杀她 恶魔会向克劳力通报凯文的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon would have warned Crowley where Kevin was if we didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力就是绑架你的那个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Crowley is the one who kidnapped you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 他需要我替他翻译一块破石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He needs me to translate his stupid tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他就能一统宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he can take over the universe or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们得拿到石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why we need to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上地狱之门 把克劳力永远关在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we can slam the gates of hell forever with Crowley inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样以后就不会发生这种惨剧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that things like that don't ever happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝的先知 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prophet of the lord, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,名号不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does have a nice ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.64,0:08:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.83,0:08:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力去过那个小木屋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need a safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得再找个藏身地 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}since Crowley's been to the cabin, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏身地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe house?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.98,0:08:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们不是要去拿石碑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were going to get the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去一个没有恶魔的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking a trip to a demon-free zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不顾凯文可能再次落到这个克劳力手上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And risk letting Kevin fall into the hands of this Crowley again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.35,0:08:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭太太 很抱歉 迪恩说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Tran, all due respect, Dean's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力可不仅仅是个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley … he's not just a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨人是他的拿手好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He trades in torment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他找到办法把你的灵魂从身体剥离\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he can find a way to separate your soul from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会把你的灵魂带去地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll take that soul to hell and …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把你的灵魂烧成渣渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}and roast it till there's nothing left but black smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是让我们来处理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's best if you let us handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不担心自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not my soul I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只担心我儿子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my son's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 你不来帮我们一把吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, you want to back us up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们大老远来就是把她从火坑里拉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came all the way down here to pull her out of the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在却想着跳回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she wants to jump right back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我能指挥得动她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I can tell her what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 跟我们一起去是有条件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Coming with us has conditions …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.39,0:09:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,用魔法袋躲开恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hex bags to stay off the bad guys' radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得帮你纹个符\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, you're gonna have to get inked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.11,0:09:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 游击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you, too, shortstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能避免恶魔附体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps the demons out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这是我第一次纹身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like it's my first tattoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻到了吗 小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell it, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧焦的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇 不远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge. So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你是怎么反驱魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how'd you do that reverse-exorcism thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.15,0:10:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒着念咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just said the verse backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:18.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（怀俄明州 拉勒米）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就目前来看 这儿没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, place is clean, far as I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 祝我们成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Positive thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然把神之语藏在尿布袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hid the word of god in a diaper bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些柜子净给我们惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got nothing but trouble with these lockers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.81,0:11:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有段时间天天被撬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got broke into damn near every day for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直不知道是谁 直到昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could never figure out who it was till yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.73,0:11:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你们知道谁干的 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, so you know who did it? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱姆·斯梅德利 我接替的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was Clem Smedley, a guy who worked the desk before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你告诉我他已经被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me he's down at county right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 就等着传讯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, waiting for arraignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.43,0:11:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,早该猜到他们会在一个包里放寻回器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have known they'd plant a lojack in one of them bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个杰里挺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharp guy, that Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,接替我正合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be a fine replacement for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中有个柜子里放着一块石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in one of those lockers, there was a tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道去哪儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.56,0:11:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的律师不在场 我能承认这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I even acknowledge that without my lawyer here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 如果你能合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look, I'm sure we can work out a little, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能和当地警方商量商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}something-something with the locals if you just cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,商量什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of something-something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他不知道 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he knows, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,宽大处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leniency?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here's what I'm thinking …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,免除一切指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full immunity from all charges,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括过去 现在和未来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}both past, present, and future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有条小溪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,流经一片空地 离这里不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It runs through a clearing not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:12:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you just tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一大街和主街交汇处的当铺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pawn shop, first and main.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days' journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着溪流走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,会出现一片空地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a clearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天使就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find your angel there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杂种 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, mutt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔和赛克探员 联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents Neil and Sixx, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在寻找一块石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're looking for a tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概有这么大 上面刻着些象形文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}About, uh, yea big, got some hieroglyphic crap on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个叫克莱姆的贼卖给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold to you by a thief named Clem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有印象吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ring a bell? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱尔 我今天过得很不顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lyle, I've had a really, really bad day today,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我没心情和你磨蹭\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm not in the mood to dillydally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想来硬的 我很乐意成全你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to do this the rough way, I am happy to oblige.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们想出名的话 那就来硬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do it that way, if you want to get famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的车是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your car outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,关你什么事 贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it to you, mail-order?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意到你的车牌照已经过期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I notice you're driving with expired tags,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为车是你从谁那儿买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe because you just acquired it in a trade,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话 你应该还没去登记\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm guessing that means you haven't registered it yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你也肯定还没交税\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means you haven't paid the tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 商品价格参考手册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, average blue book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.11,0:15:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,法拉利F430蜘蛛平均标价是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a 2010 Ferrari F430 spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十一万七千美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$217, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘以百分之五的怀俄明州税呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the 5% Wyoming tax?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一万八百五十美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$10, 850.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$10, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,直觉告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大笔税款 你肯定想逃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the type who might balk at a tax bill that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干什么 联调局查税吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what is this, an FBI audit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 但是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰巧在怀俄明州估税员办公室工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}who happens to work for the Wyoming tax assessor's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.01,0:15:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他觉得这里有人逃税\N{\fnArial\fs30}could arrange that if he thought something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.41,0:15:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒是可以来查税\N{\fnArial\fs30}untoward was happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,石碑还是那辆欧洲产的垃圾跑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tablet or that piece of Eurotrash crap you call a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定就是这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure this is the right place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当铺那家伙说的就是这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what the pawn slip says.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.65,0:16:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 迪恩 我不会偷走你的先知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, relax, Dean. I'm not going to steal your prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定就是凯文的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. And you must be Kevin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 这真是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beau, and it is my absolute pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.16,0:16:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直苦苦寻找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I was, working so hard looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,却从没想过也许你也在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I never stopped to think you might be looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.20,0:16:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场独家拍卖会的邀请函 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An invitation, dear man, to a very exclusive auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 你们要卖那块石碑 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess, where you'll be selling the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到像神之语这么烫手的山芋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when we acquire an item as hot as the word of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.46,0:16:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,明智之举当然是尽快转手\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's smart to unload it as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们也急需一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are in such desperate need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.73,0:17:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚盛会的头牌人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a headliner for tonight's gala.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你还有三张你那个拍卖会的门票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope you have three extra tickets to your little ebay party,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.03,0:17:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为先知要和我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause the prophet's with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你担心先知的人身安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, if you're worried about the safety of the prophet,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.85,0:17:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,请放心 我们有 「禁止打架 念咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}rest assured that we have a strict "No casting, no cursing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了好玩用超自然力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}no supernaturally flicking the two of you against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你俩扔到墙上「的规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}just for the fun of it " policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你怎么管住竞拍者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right? How'd you manage that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我毕竟是一位神祇的得力助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am the right hand of a God, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确的说 是普路托斯（财神）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plutus, specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.03,0:17:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都不是行星了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that even a planet anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是贪婪之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the God of greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我的神保卫拍卖堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my liege has warded these premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不受来自地狱 天堂等等的干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}against hell, heaven, and beyond…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对某些竞拍者来说还挺重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite necessary with some of the players we see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And incidentally,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你的宝贝先知 也极可能是最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}quite possibly the safest place your precious prophet could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然时间宝贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Well, since time is of the essence,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就直接在先知的邀请函上\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps I'll just go ahead and add a plus-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.60,0:17:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,多加三个名额好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the prophet's invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copacetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 花生先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you, Mr. Peanut!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有多少钱参与竞拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have to bid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总不能空着手去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? We can't just show up there empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们名下只有几张伪造的金卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, all we have to our names is a few hacked gold cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们得想想奇招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, then, we're gonna have to get creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Mnh-mnh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说出来我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it and I will kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子 还有孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}your children, and your grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.37,0:18:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些拍卖会 他们事先会向竞拍者\N{\fnArial\fs30}These…these auctions, they display the items.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,展示要拍卖的东西 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the bidders beforehand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们只要\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all we got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,让凯文靠近 然后记住咒语就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is get Kevin close enough to memorize the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, brainiac?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能背住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you can swing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.97,0:18:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然可以背住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he can swing it…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.67,0:18:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the bumper stickers on my previa mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是开玩笑 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't mean it, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.65,0:19:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有大家都合作 系统才能良好运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system only works when everyone participates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.03,0:19:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来拿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道他们都是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are we supposed to know who's who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.25,0:19:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太简单了 迪恩 他们都是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty simple, Dean. They're all monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.57,0:20:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们预计的不太一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're not as original as we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.43,0:20:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我们想个备用计划就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay. We just got to come up with a plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.41,0:20:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那第一计划是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what, pray tell, could possibly have been plan "A"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把先知带到世界上最危险的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the prophet to the most dangerous place on earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他记住石碑上的内容再溜掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}memorize the tablet, and then va-moose?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.33,0:20:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin. What a pleasure to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女朋友的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your little playdate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 有时候做事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're gonna make an omelet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,免不了要有些牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes you have to break some spines.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位可爱的女士是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is this lovely young thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是你姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:20:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我儿子远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在最想做的事 就是搂着她尸体睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defiling her corpse has just made number one on my to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为了小事大动干戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind a little love tap,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作再大一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}but anything more,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.51,0:21:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕那边的朋友就会请你们出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our mookie pals here may just throw you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.41,0:21:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就太可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that would be a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的没错 迪恩 忍一忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right, Dean. It's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是小的说话入耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to moose, squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Here comes our host.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊贵的来宾 敬请入座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honored guests, please take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是普路托斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Plutus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他算什么 糖果店的神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he, god of the candy aisle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 拍卖会开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, the auction is starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞拍顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with the bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那拳打的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice right hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.52,0:21:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 但是我认识卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, but, uh, I knew Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.78,0:21:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人是我临时就近找的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This … this was the nearest vessel on short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一般不找这类型的 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't usually come to things like this, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:21:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为石碑而来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're chasing the magic rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:21:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们负责保护神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}We protect the word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止干得漂亮啊 阿尔菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, awesome job so far, uh…Alfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.73,0:22:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真名叫萨曼德里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, my name is Samandriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是阿尔菲顺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just stick with Alfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你卡西迪奥的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to ask you about Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.54,0:22:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.17,0:22:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和小卡 杀死了迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, me and Cass … we, uh … we iced Dick Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.60,0:22:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果就搭上了去炼狱的单程火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got a one-way rocket ride to purgatory for our trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.05,0:22:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你逃出来了 那他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you escaped. Did … did Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.15,0:22:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂里至今仍有些天使坚信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there are some in heaven who still believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.51,0:22:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管他犯下那么多错\N{\fnArial\fs30}despite his mistakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.89,0:22:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥一直都只想做好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Castiel's heart was always in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.67,0:22:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是这类人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他的问题就是心肠太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think too much heart was always Castiel's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.49,0:23:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.17,0:23:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.00,0:23:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, it's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绒毛胡子挺不错 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice peach fuzz. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你介绍个朋友 这位是本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should meet somebody. This is Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.09,0:23:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼 这位是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, this is Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hola.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.84,0:23:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bloody way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.22,0:23:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.45,0:23:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我还疯着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean am I still…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.25,0:23:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,非要这么说的话 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if you want to be on the nose about it, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.87,0:23:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这回全好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm perfectly sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:24:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过94%的疯子都说自己是正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, then, 94% of psychotics think they're perfectly sane,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.70,0:24:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不如问问我们自己 什么才算正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I guess we'd have to ask ourselves, "What is sane?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.53,0:24:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.79,0:24:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么背叛了迪恩 - 别这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why'd you bail on Dean? - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说 你们是一起来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I hear it, you two hit monster land,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.09,0:24:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你自己走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hot wings here took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.55,0:24:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他该跟你解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure he owes you some backstory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.58,0:24:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时被包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we were surrounded, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.09,0:24:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有什么怪物袭击了小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some freak jumped Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.59,0:24:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他打败了他们 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, he kicked its ass, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.18,0:24:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.97,0:24:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.07,0:24:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.94,0:24:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran away?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.11,0:24:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.78,0:24:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你把我丢给狼群的借口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your excuse for leaving me with those gorilla-wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.19,0:24:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 你跑了 然后呢 去露营了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - You bailed out and, what, went camping?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.61,0:24:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天晚上向你祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prayed to you, Cass, every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.61,0:24:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 你知道还…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. - You know and you didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.87,0:24:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪根筋不对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.65,0:24:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个身在堕落之地的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am an angel in a land of abominations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.88,0:24:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多怪物从我们一到这里就盯上了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been things hunting me from the moment we arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.00,0:24:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join the club!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:24:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是一般的怪物 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are not just monsters, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.47,0:25:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.11,0:25:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a price on my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.38,0:25:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须先他们一步 才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've been trying to stay one step ahead of them, to …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.20,0:25:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能让他们远离你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep them away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.40,0:25:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我逃跑的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.84,0:25:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们请走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.99,0:25:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就这样吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a plan. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.80,0:25:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.48,0:25:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, we're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.92,0:25:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.79,0:25:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的 本尼 告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can. Benny, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.12,0:25:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱有一个出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory has an escape hatch,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.45,0:25:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对天使管不管用我就不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I got no idea if it's angel-friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.17,0:25:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.27,0:25:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 伙计 我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, buddy, I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.58,0:25:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.54,0:25:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果利维坦想攻击我们 就让他们来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if leviathan want to take a shot at us, let them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.18,0:25:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀过一次这些贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ganked those bitches once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.56,0:25:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.73,0:25:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.30,0:25:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me bottom-line it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.97,0:25:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你我不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving here without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.31,0:26:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.11,0:26:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.42,0:26:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 其他生灵们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies, gentlemen, and…other,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.26,0:26:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临千载难逢的盛典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to this once-in-a-lifetime event.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.68,0:26:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼德里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samandriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.58,0:26:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来探访贫民窟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slumming it, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.15,0:26:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法器具与炼金秘籍的第一拍卖场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first name in magical and alchemical esoterica.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.72,0:26:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的拍价不匪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our prices may be high,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.70,0:26:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是奇货自有天价\N{\fnArial\fs30}but our quality is unmatched,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.33,0:26:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且信用毋庸置疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we stand by our products.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.95,0:26:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么对一块泥巴那么上心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know why you're so keen on that hunk of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.92,0:26:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是教你们如何干掉几个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it tells you how to blast back a few demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.93,0:26:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再造就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.89,0:26:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的黑眼手下你们杀不干净的 萨曼莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't get rid of all of my black-eyed boys, Samantha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.15,0:26:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.80,0:26:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,备用计划有多少资金支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So, how much we got for plan "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.17,0:27:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有伪造的信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, we got our hacked credit cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.08,0:27:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,两千美元 还有超市会员卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}$2, 000, and a, uh, Costco membership.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.85,0:27:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一件拍品 赫斯珀勒斯的护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our first item, the amulet of hesperus.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.89,0:27:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,起拍价是 三吨矮人黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start the bidding with, um, three tons of dwarven gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.07,0:27:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. This lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.05,0:27:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现价三吨 有人出四吨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have three. Do I have, uh, four?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,四吨 这位先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Four, gentlemen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.81,0:27:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现价四吨 有人出五吨吗 五吨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four. Going for five. Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.12,0:27:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位女士出五吨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five to this lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.94,0:27:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,启用第二备用计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan "C"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.97,0:27:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.94,0:27:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有出价吗 还有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other bids? Any other bids?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.74,0:27:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去下洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna use the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.35,0:27:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.82,0:28:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.81,0:28:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不是男厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the men's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.25,0:28:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.75,0:28:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一件拍品 托尔的武器 雷神之锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our next item up for bid, the hammer of Thor, Mjoelnir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.69,0:28:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,霜巨人伊米尔的指骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A finger bone from the frost giant Ymir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.53,0:29:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,指骨 外加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…the bone and, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.65,0:29:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,八分之五个处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}5/8 of a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.55,0:29:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.95,0:29:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二备用计划失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan "C" tanked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.53,0:29:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如试试白痴计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should try plan "D" for dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.91,0:29:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一件 神之语 上帝之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our next lot, the word of God, capital "G" …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.95,0:29:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常古老 非常珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very old, very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.69,0:29:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十亿美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$3 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.69,0:29:34.25,Title,0,0,0,0,,《蒙娜丽莎》\N{\fnArial\fs30}The "Mona Lisa."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.86,0:29:38.84,Title,0,0,0,0,,《蒙娜丽莎》真品 无上装的那版\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real "Mona Lisa, " where she's topless.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.67,0:29:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,梵蒂冈城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vatican City.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.23,0:29:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉斯加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.24,0:29:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩林和绝路桥吗 敬谢不敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Palin and a bridge to nowhere? No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.31,0:29:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 月球\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. The moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.30,0:29:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出月球\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bidding the moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 是地狱属地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Claimed it for hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.73,0:29:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为巴斯光年是怎么进太空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think a man named Buzz gets to go into space without making a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.38,0:30:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. I'm sorry, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.85,0:30:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没人达到我们的预期底价\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems that our reserve price has not been met.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.24,0:30:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了刺激诸位的竞价热情\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in order to stimulate the bidding,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.27,0:30:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们增添一件拍品\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're going to add an item to this lot …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.29,0:30:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文·谭 上帝的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin Tran, prophet of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.82,0:30:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.78,0:30:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭先生是世上唯一能够解读神之语的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Tran is the only person on earth who can read this tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.68,0:30:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一对拍品珠联璧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}which makes them a perfect matching set.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.38,0:30:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是买不起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.47,0:30:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人出价吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do I hear a bid of …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.57,0:30:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.87,0:30:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要什么我都给\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.72,0:30:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的养老金 还有房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a 401K, my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.92,0:30:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常慷慨 谭夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good effort, Ms. Tran,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.85,0:30:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只怕价钱远不是你能力所及\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm afraid this is a little out of your price range.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.48,0:30:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}My soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.36,0:30:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.75,0:30:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.42,0:30:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗 这可是重大决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure? That's a big move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.85,0:30:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们要的是灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's souls that you're after,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.37,0:30:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你们一百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you a million souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.30,0:30:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行小子 你不加入吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, flyboy, are you gonna get in on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.45,0:31:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们守护天堂里的灵魂 不能拿来交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We guard the souls in heaven. We don't horse-trade them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.97,0:31:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.15,0:31:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键不在于数量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about the quantity, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.55,0:31:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在于牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.59,0:31:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位女士的灵魂是她最宝贵的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little lady's soul is the most valuable thing she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.04,0:31:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.57,0:31:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意付出一切吗 克劳力先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you willing to offer everything, Mr. Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.74,0:31:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要快哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tick-tock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.79,0:31:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.74,0:31:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.04,0:31:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}my own soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.47,0:31:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力先生 你没有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Crowley, you don't have a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.56,0:31:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congrats, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.76,0:31:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.50,0:32:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.18,0:32:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,会疼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it going to hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.26,0:32:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.59,0:32:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.32,0:32:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只会生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You'll just wish you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.49,0:32:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.64,0:32:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.93,0:32:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.07,0:32:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.91,0:32:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我单独待会儿行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I … can I just have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这可糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.50,0:32:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.22,0:32:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要永远关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to close the gates of hell forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.87,0:32:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 是我们占便宜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me, we got off cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.51,0:33:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.47,0:33:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我叫萨…阿尔菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. My name is Sam… Alfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.09,0:33:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.71,0:33:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在香肠店工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who works at Wiener Hut?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.68,0:33:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是…这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This is, uh … it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.74,0:33:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚的所作所为真的很惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what you did in here was amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.49,0:33:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.67,0:33:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的朋友可以保护你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}my friends and I can protect your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.86,0:33:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特兄弟很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters are exceptional men,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.36,0:33:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 他们也只是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…they're just men.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.74,0:33:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果凯文和我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Kevin comes with us …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.93,0:33:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.86,0:33:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次 天使想要帮助我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time that angels tried to help my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.79,0:33:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,却死在我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched them die,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.53,0:33:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而凯文失踪了近一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Kevin went missing for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.97,0:33:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.62,0:33:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这次我要相信他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm gonna take my chances with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.81,0:34:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神之锤 我好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mjoelnir, I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.02,0:34:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.52,0:34:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么处理她的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do with her soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.97,0:34:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,想怎么就怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.08,0:34:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会卖了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might sell it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.39,0:34:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会像对待其他珍贵物品一样 藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}or maybe I'll just tuck it away with my other precious objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.41,0:34:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜里用来取暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}let them keep me warm at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.44,0:34:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 就等你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever you're ready, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.70,0:34:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.87,0:34:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.91,0:34:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.34,0:34:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可能 有屏障法术\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You can't. My warding spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.56,0:34:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小妞告诉了我几处漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your girl Friday showed me a few loopholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.37,0:35:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 但是这次我要相信他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but I'm going to take my chances with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.07,0:35:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.02,0:35:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是非常非常愚蠢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was very, very stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.54,0:35:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过花了我在南太平洋的一座岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all it cost me was an island in the south Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.45,0:35:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死交易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.77,0:35:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然法力有限 但是也够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do all my tricks, but I can do enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.79,0:35:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她身上滚出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.09,0:35:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是每次有人对我这么大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had a nickel for every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能获得五美分的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone screamed that at me…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.87,0:35:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 在挖掘你女性化的一面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting in touch with your feminine side, huh, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.30,0:35:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.55,0:35:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come and get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.04,0:36:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,二取一也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}One out of two ain't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.85,0:36:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.31,0:36:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 别去 让迪恩去解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, don't! Let Dean take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.91,0:36:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.71,0:36:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.00,0:36:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有什么是比一座私人岛屿更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's better than one private island?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.32,0:36:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,两座私人岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two private islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.44,0:36:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.20,0:36:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.50,0:36:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪弄来的八分之五的处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get the 5/8 of a virgin?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.51,0:37:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.45,0:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.57,0:37:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人兴奋啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.43,0:37:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck closing the gates to hell…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.51,0:37:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你们怎么关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.04,0:37:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈脑海中念头可真让人吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprising what mommy dearest has rattling around in her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.60,0:37:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道你亲生父亲是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to know who your real father is?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.01,0:37:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 令人震惊 - 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scandalous. - Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.39,0:38:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 我知道我们不是伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we're not mates, Kevin,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.59,0:38:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但送你一个字的建议 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but one word of advice … run.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.76,0:38:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑得远远的 越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run far and run fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.50,0:38:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为温彻斯特兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause the Winchesters …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.60,0:38:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们习惯利用别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, they have a habit of using people up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.92,0:38:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后看着他们惨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watching them die bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.27,0:38:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.69,0:38:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has she said anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.55,0:38:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 凯文 你妈妈所经历的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Kev, what your mom went through …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.93,0:38:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.22,0:38:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.97,0:38:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她似乎很坚强 她会振作起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she seems tough. She'll pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.17,0:39:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想杀死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.48,0:39:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 在这世上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, in this life …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.96,0:39:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.27,0:39:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想听你那一套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear any more of your crappy speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.84,0:39:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想单独和我妈说会儿话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to talk to my mom alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.47,0:39:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.33,0:39:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.01,0:39:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.94,0:39:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 刚刚你真的是要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, were you really going to, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.17,0:39:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 撕开虎妈的喉咙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Slit soccer mom's throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.48,0:39:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我那么做就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was. I wish I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.98,0:39:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.52,0:39:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 那是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Crowley, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.71,0:39:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他在哪个肉身里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what meat suit he's in,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.93,0:39:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都应该捅死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have knifed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.35,0:40:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这样做很不好 我也会恨我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yeah, it would have sucked, and I would have hated myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.19,0:40:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是只是又添一个噩梦而已 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what's one more nightmare, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.07,0:40:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有觉得那里有点太安静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seem a little quiet in there to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.64,0:40:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.82,0:40:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.44,0:40:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.75,0:40:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.46,0:40:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.40,0:40:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.34,0:40:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逃走了 劝我们别去追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that they bolted, that we shouldn't come looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.08,0:40:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们没了石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and since we lost the tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.14,0:40:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文觉得我们不需要他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin figures we don't need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.30,0:40:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但是克劳力有石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Crowley still does.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.69,0:40:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子想什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that kid thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.60,0:40:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得对我没用处的人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks people I don't need anymore they end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.52,0:40:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 那…那不是真的 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, that … that … that's not true. You know that.
